#: src/win.py:657
msgid ""
"<html><b>Welcome to the ATI GPU Monitor (KAtiMon)</b><br/><br/>This is a KDE "
"program for monitoring and controlling some aspects of your ATI graphics "
"card.<br/>You can access KAtiMon by clicking on its system tray icon.<br/"
"><br/><u>Note that this program is NOT developed by ATI/AMD: please do not "
"send them any bug reports.</u><br/></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><b>Willkamen bi den Kieker för ATI-GPUs (KAtiMon)</b><br/><br/>Dit is "
"en KDE-Programm, mit dat sik en poor Egenschappen vun Dien ATI-Grafikkoort "
"beluern un instellen laat.<br/>KAtiMon lett sik mit en Klick op't Lüttbild "
"binnen den Systeemafsnitt opmaken.<br/><br/><u>Beacht, dit Programm wöör "
"NICH vun ATI/AMD schreven: stüer ATI un AMD bitte keen Fehlerberichten to.</"
"u><br/></html>"

#: src/win.py:670
msgid ""
"<html>It seems that your graphics card does not have a fan, or that it is "
"not possible to control it using the aticonfig tool.<br/>The fan controlling "
"and monitoring capability of this program has been disabled.<br/><br/>If "
"this is incorrect, please send a bug report.</html>"
msgstr ""
"<html>As't lett hett Dien Grafikkoort keen Püüster, oder he lett sik mit "
"\"aticonfig\" nich stüern.<br/>Dat Stüern un Beluern wöör utmaakt.<br/><br/"
">Wenn dit verkehrt is, stüer bitte en Fehlerbericht loos.</html>"

#: src/win.py:675
msgid "No fan"
msgstr "Keen Püüster"

#: src/win.py:692
#, python-format
msgid ""
"When this program exits it restores the fan speed to its original value (i."
"e. the speed that was set when the program was started).<br/>This only "
"happens when you use the auto-fan speed feature, which is the default.<br/"
">If you want to set a specific fan speed, set it manually before closing the "
"program.<br/><br/>The fan speed will be restored to %1%."
msgstr ""
"Dat Programm kann bi't Utmaken de Püüstergauheit op ehr Orginaalweert "
"torüchsetten (d.h., de Gauheit bi den Programmstart),<br/>man bloots, wenn "
"de Standardinstellen \"automaatsch Püüstergauheit\" bruukt warrt.<br/>Wenn "
"Du en anner Püüstergauheit instellen wullt, legg ehr vun Hand fast, ehr Du "
"dat Programm utmaakst.<br/><br/>De Püüstergauheit warrt op %1% torüchsett."

#: src/win.py:700
msgid "Fan speed restoration"
msgstr "Püüstergauheit torüchsetten"

#: src/win.py:707
msgid ""
"The current fan speed has been set manually. Normally, the program restores "
"the fan to the speed at which it was originally operating when the program "
"was started. Alternatively, you can keep your manual fan speed setting.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to restore the original fan speed?"
msgstr ""
"De aktuell Gauheit wöör vun Hand instellt. Normalerwies sett dat Programm de "
"Püüstergauheit op den Startweert torüch. Du kannst man ok de vun Hand "
"fastleggt Gauhiet wohren.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du de Orginaalgauheit wedderherstellen?"

#: src/win.py:712
msgid "Confirm fan speed setting"
msgstr "Püüstergauheit-Instellen beglöven"

#: src/win.py:742
msgid "ATI Temperature Monitor, Fan Regulator and Overclocking Utility"
msgstr "ATI-Temperatuurkieker, Püüster-Kuntrull un Övertakten-Programm"

#: src/win.py:744
msgid "Copyright (c) 2009 Stefanos Harhalakis"
msgstr "Copyright © 2009: Stefanos Harhalakis"

#: src/win.py:745
msgid ""
"This is an utility that monitors and controls supported ATI graphics cards. "
"It can:<ul><li>monitor temperature, fan speed, GPU speed and memory speed;"
"<li>auto-control fan speed by monitoring the temperature;<li>act as an "
"overclocking utility for cards that support it.</ul><p>Created with python, "
"pyqt, pykde4 and pyqwt.<p>Have fun using it and be careful when overclocking."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Kiek- un Kuntrullprogramm för ATI-Grafikkoorten. Dormit lett "
"sik:<ul><li>De Temperatuur, Püüster-, GPU- un Spiekergauheit beluern.<li>De "
"Püüstergauheit automaatsch de Temperatuur topassen.<li>Ünnerstütt "
"Grafikkoorten övertakten.</ul><p>Dit Programm wöör mit Python, Pyqt, Pykde4 "
"un Pyqwt opstellt.<p>Veel Spaaß ok, un bruuk dat Övertakten mit Bedacht."

